{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/a329c135e272effc909ae0923b6e728a.poster.avif?t=1758125383\" width=800 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/a329c135e272effc909ae0923b6e728a.webm?t=1758125383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/a329c135e272effc909ae0923b6e728a.mp4?t=1758125383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You're one in 9 million. A citizen of a dystopia far from earth.\u00a0</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Unrest threatens, authority crushes, over-population smothers. </i></strong> <br><strong><i>You're a scav, a pilot. One of the free, one able to escape the crowding - to fly and earn.\u00a0</i></strong> <br><strong><i>The skies beckon.. threaten.. </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>But will you use your freedom for good?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Null Anchor gives you the simple joy of customization, combat and flight WITHOUT needing a joystick, a 1 hour YouTube tutorial or a pledge for the game to release in over a decade ;-P\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/1c0e73985280276210e642380a0df419.poster.avif?t=1758125383\" width=800 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/1c0e73985280276210e642380a0df419.webm?t=1758125383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/1c0e73985280276210e642380a0df419.mp4?t=1758125383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born out of a 90s kid's dream to be an adult in a SCIFI future; you survive in a teeming city, earning a living by whatever means, upgrading your hunk of metal, honing your dogfighting skills and building an empire in this crater-land.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/568430746702145cf234c9bbed6b643c.avif?t=1758125383\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've tried to shatter the barrier to entry by using simple WASD and FPS control schemes, steering clear of complex game logic and implementing intuitive combat and damage systems. Utilizing a simplified flight model with no inversion, helps players concentrate on strategy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897790?t=1758125383","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/f61fed315e32af638de83bfa8ba90a816235213e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758125383","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/6b39ac111683d36fa65a7b6ab0372afeceebc140/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758125383","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/6b39ac111683d36fa65a7b6ab0372afeceebc140/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758125383","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Mild violence depicted in the form of ships being destroyed. Pirate factions and the ability to commit theft is present. Ability to trade in illegal goods, such as drugs and thematically(non-real-world) banned substances or devices."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/a329c135e272effc909ae0923b6e728a.poster.avif?t=1758125383\" width=800 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/a329c135e272effc909ae0923b6e728a.webm?t=1758125383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/a329c135e272effc909ae0923b6e728a.mp4?t=1758125383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You're one in 9 million. A citizen of a dystopia far from earth.\u00a0</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Unrest threatens, authority crushes, over-population smothers. </i></strong> <br><strong><i>You're a scav, a pilot. One of the free, one able to escape the crowding - to fly and earn.\u00a0</i></strong> <br><strong><i>The skies beckon.. threaten.. </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>But will you use your freedom for good?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Null Anchor gives you the simple joy of customization, combat and flight WITHOUT needing a joystick, a 1 hour YouTube tutorial or a pledge for the game to release in over a decade ;-P\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/1c0e73985280276210e642380a0df419.poster.avif?t=1758125383\" width=800 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/1c0e73985280276210e642380a0df419.webm?t=1758125383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/1c0e73985280276210e642380a0df419.mp4?t=1758125383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born out of a 90s kid's dream to be an adult in a SCIFI future; you survive in a teeming city, earning a living by whatever means, upgrading your hunk of metal, honing your dogfighting skills and building an empire in this crater-land.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/568430746702145cf234c9bbed6b643c.avif?t=1758125383\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've tried to shatter the barrier to entry by using simple WASD and FPS control schemes, steering clear of complex game logic and implementing intuitive combat and damage systems. Utilizing a simplified flight model with no inversion, helps players concentrate on strategy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["TotesAwks"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/128064d8d2ba64372d01122f985f307f9c3e455a/header.jpg?t=1758125383","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul cla